* A call of a macro using \Ln outside macro bodies: the argument lengths set before it (as r68
* counts them: quotes stripped) and the macro called directly. Through r68L, its irpc aligned
* after an odd dc.b, and its ifnc took no argument with a quote (MAC #2,"#'C'").
* fixed: 19bd6e7 2026-10-11 r68togas: macros using \Ln called directly outside macro bodies
* expect text: 07020403 04000001 00034e71
LEN macro
 dc.b \L1,\L2,\L3
 endm
W macro
 dc.w \L1
 endm
 psect lmacro_direct,0,0,0,0,0
 dc.b 7
 LEN ab,"#'C'",'xyz'
 dc.b 4
 W a
 W "a b"
 nop
 ends
